e", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561197960516534/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 4, "playtime_forever": 25212, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 11320, "last_played": 1789155081, "avatar": "cf54d55ba5dfc960d95483bbba3ad25892b4b005"}, "language": "english", "review": "Best game ive played in some time... lots of replayability... always funner with friends!  Solid game that i have yet to crash or find a bug in and thats saying alot these days!", "timestamp_created": 1623100817, "timestamp_updated": 1623100817, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.529842793941497803", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "93372804", "author": {"steamid": "76561198039397163", "personaname": "Red Yeen Lion", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198039397163/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 15, "playtime_forever": 1930, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 193, "last_played": 1777437150, "avatar": "56aa0819f1600b7d6de0865ded1fb4ce6970d274"}, "language": "english", "review": "Good game.  fun to play with friends,  The game has the look of games like deep rock galactic, cute characters, fun arsenal, and good progression (as you will fail, and start again with better skills and access to better weapons).\n\nMy biggest gripes about the game, in it's current state, are: you have to unlock the additional characters, so anyone under level 25 (which takes a good few attempts to reach) will have to play as the exact same character, which can lead to whole parties being the crown prince (starting char).  The fact that the game is in desperate need of customization, as previously stated, until level 25 you have to play as the crown prince, but there is also no way of changing the way you look.  This leads indistinguishable teammates, and lack of creative freedom.  The game desperately needs either or both a second starting character available to play at lvl1, or changeable clothes/fur colors/patterns for your char, to distinguish you between your friends, each playing one of the only 4 characters in the game currently.  The last gripe is that the first dungeon gets heavily repetitive, since you have to start over from the beginning every time you and your party all die.  checkpoints do not exist.  the maps are 'slightly' procedural, but that just comes down to vault placement, and which doors are open or closed.", "timestamp_created": 1623097151, "timestamp_updated": 1623097151, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "93366919", "author": {"steamid": "76561198142354126", "personaname": "ItsMeKiiirsTea", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/ItsMeKiiirstea/", "num_games_owned": 197, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 1055, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 284, "last_played": 1624611569, "avatar": "57c698beb856e745488c297725ebbe83b31532a5"}, "language": "english", "review": "this is such a fun game was gifted by a friends and now i cant stop playing", "timestamp_created": 1623089744, "timestamp_updated": 1623089744, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1637202540", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "93365295", "author": {"steamid": "76561197982302518", "personaname